<<~ ahu slot=`#/tests-harness-with-lar-root-ts`>>

!! `tests/harness/with-lar-root.ts` (32 lines, read whole)
`withLarRoot(root, work)` sets `process.env.LAR_ROOT`, awaits `work`, restores in `finally`. Its header states it is not thread-safe against concurrent vessels in one process. 152 call sites: 30 files in packages/lararium-node/tests, 4 in tests/e2e, 2 in tests/harness. It exists ONLY because `identityDir()` and every home resolver read env with no parameter; the header cites the live footgun (`persona-ring-cross-operator-admit.test.ts`).

