`larIdentityDir`: 24 files (custody-root, custody-seat, face-atom-store, face-bundle-restore, face-key-custody, fleet-join-custody, founder-self-certificate, hosting-face, identity-anchors, intent-relay-key-store, node-circle-store, node-vessel-identity, node-walk-store, recovery-share-store, relay-gate-seed, seat-key-store, switch-act-log, vault-carriers, cadence-key-store, cofound-record, init, and cli found/vault/env). `larSealHome`: 35 files (open-node-vessel, nexus-//, seal-ceremony, sealed-acts, roll-circle-//, cabal-*, device-admit, fleet-join, found-hearth, hearth-aid, main, node-daemon-island, and the cli nexus/vault/store-door). `larDataDir`: 19 files. `larBootstrapPath`: 19. Tests naming them: 78 / 38 / 80 / 32 files. 15 of the resolvers are ambient, so every one of those files is a leaf of env.

